   "md": "- **Article 96:** the Speaker (or Deputy Speaker) shall not preside while a resolution for his removal is under consideration; he may speak and vote in the first instance, but has no casting vote."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 31,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **M. Ananthasayanam Ayyangar:** first Deputy Speaker of the Lok Sabha (1952–56); became Speaker in 1956 after G.V. Mavalankar's death."
  }
